    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d6-a2">

                <pb facs="0074" n="6" sameAs="frus:frus1914-20v01/pg6"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 2—Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Wilson to the
                            Niagara Section of the New York Peace Society
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-21">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 21, 1914</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I fear the plan you speak of might lead to very serious results of a sort that
                    would defeat your purpose. I beg therefore that before proceeding you will let
                    me know more particularly what you have in mind. I would appreciate a
                    letter.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Woodrow Wilson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
